0..55 Comment "//! What is not open stays at the world it was made at."
56..59 Comment "//!"
60..137 Comment "//! A handle crosses as the content of the value it holds. A thunk crosses by"
138..211 Comment "//! what it captures. A thunk over a value that is not mobile is not open"
212..259 Comment "//! under a handle, and not mobile without one."
260..263 Comment "//!"
264..341 Comment "//! Each declaration migrates to the seat and returns a thunk over the seat\'s"
342..414 Comment "//! unmarked dispatch. The refusal names the judgement that fails at the"
415..494 Comment "//! capture: `NotOpen.Capture` under a handle, `Immobile.Capture` met directly."
495..498 Comment "//!"
499..511 Comment "//! - cites:"
512..612 Comment "//!   [Rainey-2026-localmem_typedirected_adaptive_serialization_location_contentaddressable_memory],"
613..635 Comment "//!   § 5.1, openness"
636..697 Comment "//! - see: `model/worlds/open.gandr` — what is open crosses"
698..701 Comment "//!"
702..941 Comment "//! [Rainey-2026-localmem_typedirected_adaptive_serialization_location_contentaddressable_memory]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3828688 \"Rainey et al., LoCalMem: Type-Directed Adaptive Serialization for Location- and Content-Addressable Memory\""
